  "behavior": [
    "tools/list advertises editCategory with sourceId, a nonempty name/color/iconName patch and the same declared hash fields; no List-only notes or admin operations are added.",
    "A guarded rename and subsequent icon/color clears preserve unrelated changes despite old guards for fields absent from each patch. The final Category reopens with exact content/timestamps/hashes.",
    "A compound name/color patch with stale name rejects together. Only the conflicting name/current value/hash are reported and the complete prior wire read remains equal.",
    "A stale color edit after clearing reports current color null. Original rename replay returns its original complete result/checkpoint and preserves the later clears.",
    "Eleven invalid source/patch/hash cases reject with exact classification and JSON Pointer. Saved content, lifetime, dates and hashes remain unchanged, no applied operation evidence appears, and recovery retains only the original creation checkpoint.",
    "Structured and text JSON agree across executed success and rejection responses. Seven existing List journeys also pass."
  ],
